ld/validate] [:db/add "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/id #uuid "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646"] [:db/add "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/problem "Use the substitution $u=2 x$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=2 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(2)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{2}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{1 - 4 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$"] [:db/add "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/answer-fields "c2825285-e973-5123-8c82-22051c2857ad"] [:db/ensure "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "6d8c319f-72a5-5885-99e0-079767154646"] [:db/add "5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312" :answer/id #uuid "5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312"] [:db/add "5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312" :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "5d231189-769b-5732-ace7-6461f3b15312" :answer/validate] [:db/add "fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033" :answer/id #uuid "fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033"] [:db/add "fa4fd602-fb90-5466-9105-9362a34b9033" :answer/type :answer.t