tion/problem "Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{8}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $4\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{8}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{8}} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{1 - 16 x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\n$$"] [:db/add "31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324" :question/answer-fields "455b54ae-fb4e-51b4-9b57-73bd4b9e1f9d"] [:db/ensure "31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "31e905b6-c251-53f6-8de0-854ce3af6324"] [:db/add "9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12" :answer/id #uuid "9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12"] [:db/add "9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12" :answer/value "- \\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right)"] [:db/ensure "9bdd67e1-4beb-54d3-b9e9-eeb6ff9c2b12" :answer/validate] [:db/add "dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf" :answer/id #uuid "dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf"] [:db/add "dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42838cf" :answer/value "\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u"] [:db/ensure "dff3c3ba-174c-59a9-a7d6-ee62a42