es "d67390ab-7f56-5eab-9802-08b91490b693"] [:db/add "dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691" :answer-field/correct "ffc45760-e969-5f79-a809-324f6b4539a4"] [:db/ensure "dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/id #uuid "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee"] [:db/add "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/problem "Use the substitution $u=4 x$. Which integral is obtained?\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$"] [:db/add "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=4 x$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(4)\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=\\frac{1}{4}\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $2\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{1}{4}&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{4}} \\frac{2}{16 x^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe transformed integral is\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\n$$"] [:db/add "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/answer-fields "dda9ad6d-761a-5204-abdd-09a476b38691"] [:db/ensure "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "8165fa70-1166-5f10-bb32-499a1e0700ee"] [:db/add "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0" :answer/id #uuid "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0"] [:db/add "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0" :answer/value "\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}"] [:db/ensure "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/id #uuid "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee"] [:db/add "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/choices "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0"] [:db/add "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/correct "21197bf9-2b81-5ac7-8c46-599b9dd9fed0"] [:db/ensure "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/id #uuid "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a"] [:db/add "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}=4\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{4})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $1\\cdot 4=4$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{4}{\\sqrt{16 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=4\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n4\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=4\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{2 \\pi}{3}.\n$$"] [:db/add "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/answer-fields "c55102e2-8ac3-5c1e-9026-690c0be8c3ee"] [:db/ensure "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "5b0acf8e-9b1e-5ef1-915d-3d20f3467d5a"] [:db/add "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85" :answer/id #uuid "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85"] [:db/add "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85" :answer/validate] [:db/add "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/id #uuid "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc"] [:db/add "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/choices "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85"] [:db/add "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/correct "d97abc82-4a04-5bc5-ad2b-ec73cfff0c85"] [:db/ensure "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/id #uuid "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d"] [:db/add "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{4}\\cdot 4=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{4}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/answer-fields "5c988bbf-80f6-580d-b23c-9d777dfb2dbc"] [:db/ensure "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "c8dd9867-dd31-5c13-baea-ef32e696ea0d"] [:db/add "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7" :answer/id #uuid "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7"] [:db/add "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{6}"] [:db/ensure "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7" :answer/validate] [:db/add "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/id #uuid "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32"] [:db/add "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/choices "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7"] [:db/add "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/correct "f4ce1593-21be-58fe-8716-c7cdedf915f7"] [:db/ensure "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/id #uuid "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601"] [:db/add "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{3}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{3})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}=3\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{3})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=3\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{3}\\cdot 3=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=\\frac{3}{2}&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{\\frac{3}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{9 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{6}.\n$$"] [:db/add "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/answer-fields "3787a9f0-915a-565d-803f-d861322f1a32"] [:db/ensure "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "bbf8ae14-6723-512f-93e9-c8784d3ce601"] [:db/add "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581" :answer/id #uuid "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581"] [:db/add "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{8}"] [:db/ensure "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581" :answer/validate] [:db/add "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/id #uuid "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2"] [:db/add "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/choices "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581"] [:db/add "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/correct "752d5c38-aae6-5338-ab74-b34f77ca7581"] [:db/ensure "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/id #uuid "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575"] [:db/add "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{4}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{4})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 16=16\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{4})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=4\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{8}\\cdot 4=\\frac{1}{2}$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=4&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{4} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 16}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}\\right)=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{8}.\n$$"] [:db/add "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/answer-fields "f0e7ca9e-841b-531b-a4f0-3cbddc3883f2"] [:db/ensure "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "8d454498-8e2d-5fa9-93ca-5a57d26ac575"] [:db/add "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52" :answer/id #uuid "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52"] [:db/add "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{2}"] [:db/ensure "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52" :answer/validate] [:db/add "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/id #uuid "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b"] [:db/add "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/choices "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52"] [:db/add "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/correct "b4442b25-4856-563c-a354-75d5a7986c52"] [:db/ensure "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/id #uuid "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203"] [:db/add "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arcsin{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arcsin{\\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{6}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\n\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}=2\\sqrt{1-(\\frac{x}{2})^2}.\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{3}{2}\\cdot 2=3$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=1&\\Longrightarrow u=\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{4 - x^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=3\\left(\\int_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}} \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{1 - u^{2}}}\\,\\mathrm{d}u\\right).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n3\\left(\\left[\\arcsin{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{\\frac{1}{2}}\\right)=3\\left(\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{6}\\right)-\\left(0\\right)\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{2}.\n$$"] [:db/add "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/answer-fields "7417936b-d70e-5012-b79b-d3dccd8da46b"] [:db/ensure "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "8acbeaf6-4a49-5cff-9bbf-1d990a1f3203"] [:db/add "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca" :answer/id #uuid "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca"] [:db/add "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca" :answer/type :answer.type/math] [:db/add "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca" :answer/value "\\frac{\\pi}{4}"] [:db/ensure "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/id #uuid "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564"] [:db/add "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/key "answer"] [:db/add "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] [:db/add "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/choices "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca"] [:db/add "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/correct "655b0f49-fcfd-5ba2-beeb-83411fb11bca"] [:db/ensure "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/id #uuid "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88"] [:db/add "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/problem "Evaluate exactly.\n\n$$\n\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\n$$\n\nYou may use $\\int \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u=\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}+C$.\n\nEndpoint values: $\\arctan{\\left(0 \\right)}=0,\\quad \\arctan{\\left(1 \\right)}=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.\n\n{{answer}}"] [:db/add "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/worked-solution "Let $u=\\frac{x}{2}$. Then $\\mathrm{d}u=(\\frac{1}{2})\\,\\mathrm{d}x$.\n\nFactor the constant in the denominator:\n\n$$\nx^{2} + 4=4\\left(1+(\\frac{x}{2})^2\\right).\n$$\n\nThe differential is $\\mathrm{d}x=2\\,\\mathrm{d}u$. The outside factor is $\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot 2=1$.\n\nTransform both bounds:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x=0&\\Longrightarrow u=0\\\\x=2&\\Longrightarrow u=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nIncluding the differential factor gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}&\\int_{0}^{2} \\frac{2}{x^{2} + 4}\\,\\mathrm{d}x\\\\&=\\int_{0}^{1} \\frac{1}{u^{2} + 1}\\,\\mathrm{d}u.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nApply the supplied primitive and subtract lower from upper:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\arctan{\\left(u \\right)}\\right]_{0}^{1}=\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)-\\left(0\\right).\n$$\n\nThe exact answer is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\pi}{4}.\n$$"] [:db/add "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] [:db/add "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/answer-fields "c3a3de38-19e2-573b-8df5-7b7b7688a564"] [:db/ensure "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186064220 :knowledge-point/questions "7c04b91e-e6f9-52ef-8ef4-38b49a786e88"] [:db/add "98984389-6c56-5627-9dcc-17a55eb70207" :answer/id #uuid "98984389-6